# Godot's import cache and reimported assets. Regenerated on open, and its paths are absolute, so a
# committed copy is wrong on every other machine. The `.import` files beside each asset are NOT here
# on purpose — those hold the import settings and belong in the repo.
game/.godot/

# Android build template, only present once one is installed.
game/android/

# Export presets carry absolute paths to the output and to the signing keys.
game/export_presets.cfg

# Aseprite's session backups.
art/*.aseprite-session
art/backup/

# The exports themselves. The repo holds the source, not the build.
build/
*.exe
*.pck
*.zip
